WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,240
You killed that senior sister on the rooftop, right?

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
I saw it all

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,780
Let’s look at the points first

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,780
Temporary task completed

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,780
Form a goddess team

6
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,780
first exploration

7
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,780
Get unlimited machine choices once

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,780
Information found

9
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,780
The task is rewarded

10
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,880
But she didn't even pass the average

11
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,100
The system recognizes a score of 85 or above

12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,100
Far from it

13
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,510
Don't even think about leaving

14
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,510
you killed someone

15
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,510
To be imprisoned

16
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,510
But as long as you protect me

17
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,510
I'll hide it for you

18
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:36,510
You don’t want to be caught and shot, right?

19
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,510
What I killed were plainclothes zombies.

20
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:39,510
not human

21
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,150
That's unclear

22
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,150
So be it

23
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,150
Give me the knife and let me borrow it from you

24
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,150
I'll pay you back later

25
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:47,150
I can also kill zombies to protect myself

26
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:49,150
So you were waiting for me here

27
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,150
Find out the crime first

28
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:54,600
Come and ask for my knife again

29
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,600
I think it's a 24-hour borrowing right.

30
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:10,660
That's senior Han Jianghai from the meeting club

31
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:11,660
I still know
